      <p class="fig"><strong>A note on what is not in here.</strong> Every patent status above comes from Google Patents&#x27; mirror of the registries, which is not a legal opinion. The cost figures from other industries are for coarse tailings in other countries and other years, and no one has yet shown that oil sands clay filters at all. The paper says so where it uses them.</p>

